# ⚠️ Windows'da ishlab chiqilgan, Linux konteynerida bajariladigan fayllar.
# CRLF bilan saqlangan .sh fayli konteynerda "exec format error" beradi —
# bu xato sababi ko'rinmaydi va vaqt yeydi.
*.sh text eol=lf
entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Matn fayllar — repo ichida LF
*.py text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf

# Ikkilik fayllar — tegilmasin
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
